<section
  id="brand-story"
  style="
    background-color: #0d0d0d;
    padding: 96px 0;
  "
>
  <div style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem;">

    <div
      style="
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 48px;
        align-items: center;
      "
      class="brand-story-grid"
    >

      <!-- Left: copy -->
      <div>
        <!-- Eyebrow -->
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          <div style="height: 1px; width: 32px; background-color: #C9A84C;"></div>
          <span
            style="
              font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
              font-size: 11px;
              font-weight: 900;
              letter-spacing: 0.2em;
              text-transform: uppercase;
              color: #C9A84C;
            "
          >The Story</span>
        </div>

        <!-- H2 -->
        <h2
          style="
            margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
            font-family: 'Arial Black', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            line-height: 1.1;
            color: #e5e5e5;
          "
        >
          Born From<br>
          <span class="gold-text">The Era</span>
        </h2>

        <!-- Paragraphs -->
        <p
          style="
            margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9375rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: #737373;
            max-width: 480px;
          "
        >
          In the early 2000s, hip-hop didn&rsquo;t just make music &mdash; it built empires.
          Rocawear, Sean John, G-Unit: these weren&rsquo;t just labels, they were
          statements of culture, power, and identity. We grew up in that era and
          never left it.
        </p>
        <p
          style="
            margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9375rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: #737373;
            max-width: 480px;
          "
        >
          The 00s Version is a love letter to that moment. Premium fabrics,
          silhouettes that carry weight, and details that only heads will
          recognise. This is streetwear with memory.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <a href="/collections/all" class="btn-gold">Shop the Vision</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: decorative box -->
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center;">
        <div
          style="
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            aspect-ratio: 1/1;
            background-color: #111111;
            border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 2rem;
          "
        >

          <!-- Corner accent: top-left -->
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            style="
              position: absolute;
              top: 12px;
              left: 12px;
              width: 20px;
              height: 20px;
              border-top: 2px solid #C9A84C;
              border-left: 2px solid #C9A84C;
            "
          ></div>

          <!-- Corner accent: bottom-right -->
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            style="
              position: absolute;
              bottom: 12px;
              right: 12px;
              width: 20px;
              height: 20px;
              border-bottom: 2px solid #C9A84C;
              border-right: 2px solid #C9A84C;
            "
          ></div>

          <!-- Corner accent: top-right -->
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            style="
              position: absolute;
              top: 12px;
              right: 12px;
              width: 20px;
              height: 20px;
              border-top: 2px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);
              border-right: 2px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);
            "
          ></div>

          <!-- Corner accent: bottom-left -->
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            style="
              position: absolute;
              bottom: 12px;
              left: 12px;
              width: 20px;
              height: 20px;
              border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);
              border-left: 2px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);
            "
          ></div>

          <!-- Decorative text -->
          <div style="text-align: center;">
            <span
              class="gold-shimmer"
              style="
                display: block;
                font-family: 'Arial Black', Arial, sans-serif;
                font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4rem);
                font-weight: 900;
                letter-spacing: -0.02em;
                line-height: 1;
              "
            >00s</span>
            <div style="height: 1px; background-color: #1a1a1a; margin: 12px 0;"></div>
            <span
              class="gold-shimmer"
              style="
                display: block;
                font-family: 'Arial Black', Arial, sans-serif;
                font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
                font-weight: 900;
                letter-spacing: 0.3em;
                text-transform: uppercase;
              "
            >Version</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Subtle radial glow -->
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            style="
              position: absolute;
              inset: 0;
              background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(201,168,76,0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
              pointer-events: none;
            "
          ></div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .brand-story-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important;
      gap: 80px !important;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Brand Story",
  "limit": 1,
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Brand Story"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
